note omega.universal.lower.v1 semantic 8dc67eafc9e818d649f0cbcc59d226acbb7b2fd7fd4318f2e6b9a4d67a69fd1b
fn calc i0 ulong i1 ulong to ulong
v = new ulong 7 0
put v 0 i0
put v 1 i1
put v 2 add get v 0 get v 1
put v 3 sub get v 0 get v 1
put v 4 mul get v 2 get v 3
put v 5 0
put v 6 add get v 4 get v 5
ret get v 6
end
